        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Luigi Cherubini, Michael Tippett, Étienne Méhul\n- Works: Épicure\n- Places: France\n- Roles: composers\n\nFacts:\n- Luigi Cherubini was born on 8 or 14 September 1760 and died on 15 March 1842.\n- Luigi Cherubini was an Italian composer who spent most of his working life in France.\n- Michael Tippett was born on 2 January 1905 and died on 8 January 1998.\n- Sir Michael Kemp Tippett was an English composer who rose to prominence during and immediately after the Second World War.\n- Épicure is an opera in three acts.\n- Épicure has music by the composers Étienne Méhul and Luigi Cherubini.",
